# Search-tool ignore (ripgrep, fd). Git already ignores raw/ via the root
# .gitignore, but that pattern is anchored to the repo root, so it is not
# applied when a search is rooted at `data/` instead. raw/ holds verbatim
# third-party catalog captures that build.py reads; it is not repo source and
# should never show up in a code search.
raw/
